{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14780","headline":"送信州姚使君 · 卢纶","name":"送信州姚使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朱幡徐转候羣官，猨鸟无声郡宇宽。\n楚国上腴收赋重，汉家良牧得人难。\n铜铅满穴山能富，鸿鴈连羣地亦寒。\n几日政声闻户外，九江行旅得相欢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14780.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14780","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}